|---|---|---|
| `server-caddy-proxy-1` | `0.0.0.0:80/443` | Caddyfile = `/home/pebor/server/Caddyfile` |
| `forgejo` | `0.0.0.0:222` → container `22` | `git.pebor.me` behind Caddy |
| `server-sp1-1` + `-db-1` + `-backup-1` | `127.0.0.1:5432` (db, loopback only) | Super Productivity + its own backup sidecar |
| `logseq-selfhost-sync` | `0.0.0.0:8787` | private |
| `notifun`, `server-vizcube-1` | internal `3000` / `80,443` | behind Caddy |
| `minecraft.service` | `*:25565` | **systemd unit, not compose** — moving to t490s (kanban #18) |
| `valheim-relay.service` | nftables DNAT `2456-2458/udp` → `100.103.136.50` | `active (exited)`, enabled; counters moving (34 pkt DNAT / 36 MASQ on 2026-10-25) |
| `beszel-agent` (compose, `~/beszel`) | host network, dials **out** to `wss://mon.pebor.me` | reports this VPS to the hub on t490s; no inbound port, firewall untouched. System shows as `vps` |
| `ssh` | `0.0.0.0:1234` | key-only, `pebor`, NOPASSWD sudo |

Baseline resources: `3.7 GiB` RAM (≈`200 MiB` free), `38 GB` disk (`9.6 G` used, `27 G` free).

Hetzner Cloud firewall: only `80/443/1234` tcp, `41641` udp and `2456-2458`
udp pass. **Outbound rules must stay EMPTY** — one outbound rule silently
kills apt/ACME egress.

## Backups

- One restic sidecar (`backup` stack), nightly **03:30**, repo
  `/home/server/backup/backups`, log `~/backup/backups/*.log`.
- Covers: the files store (`~/files`), hot sqlite snapshots (`sqlite3 .backup`) of
  filebrowser, vikunja, **fin** and **hermes `state.db`**, hermes
  `memories/ skills/ plugins/ personal/` (`.env`/`secrets.env` excluded — they live
  in Bitwarden), beszel hub data, radicale data, valheim config, plus the stack
  dirs (`~/filebrowser`, `~/beszel`, `~/vikunja`, `~/radicale`, `~/edge`,
  `~/valheim`, `~/fin`). Vaultwarden has its own sidecar.
- Retired stacks (`~/collabora`, `~/copyparty`, `~/nextcloud`) were deleted on
  2026-10-29 and are intentionally NOT backed up.
- ⚠️ **Local only** — same NVMe as the data, no offsite target yet.

## Secrets

Source of truth is Vaultwarden (tailnet `:8445`), service account
`hermes@pebor.me`, items named `<system>/<thing>` (e.g. `valheim/server-pass`,
`filebrowser/sp-token`, `vikunja/*`, `restic/t490s-cloud`). **No values belong in this
file**, and `docker inspect` env dumps are off limits (they print every secret).

